            <tr><td>City of Dalaran</td><td>28-33</td><td>Backfiring enchantments, haywire arcane constructs and demonic energy stirring after the shield vanishes</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Blackmaw Hold</td><td>55-60</td><td>Corrupted furbolg city in Azshara that leads into mountain tunnels</td></tr>
