    <p class="meta-info">Table per classicwowforever.com's racial-reference capture of the September 12 pre-release build. The Undead Paladin pairs with the Forsaken Paladin thread featured in the <em>Warcraft III Reforged: Forsaken Kingdom</em> campaign.</p>
    <h3>Skyborne racials</h3>
    <ul class="plain-list">
        <li><strong>Walk on Air</strong> — glide down through the air for 10 seconds (both factions)</li>
        <li><strong>Windshaper (Horde)</strong> — Skysight: run 10% faster while under an Elemental Blessing</li>
        <li><strong>High Order (Alliance)</strong> — Read Ley Line: activating a ley line grants 100% more Health and Mana regeneration</li>
