<section class="panel cp-span-full" id="ps">
    <h2>What It Means for Private Servers</h2>
    <p>Blizzard's legal campaign against private servers has run on a similar clock to Forever's development: Turtle WoW sued August 2025 (offline May 2026), Stormforge closed May 2026, Project Ascension hit with a nine-count suit including RICO claims in June 2026. Correlation is not causation — but the practical effect is that the largest custom Classic servers are being dismantled in the same window Blizzard prepares its own expanded Vanilla product. Our full analysis: <a href="/news/blizzcon-2026-camelot-private-servers/">BlizzCon 2026 Preview</a>, and what displaced players are doing about it in <a href="/news/turtle-wow-successor-wave/">the Turtle WoW successor wave</a>.</p>
</section>

